{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>據Tech Spot最新發佈的報告，英偉達GeForce RTX 50系列顯卡自發售以來價格持續飆升。</strong>旗艦型號RTX 5090在美國市場較建議零售價(MSRP)漲幅高達370%，全球平均漲幅約262%，成為近年來漲幅最為突出的主流遊戲GPU。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584856.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:42:48.168945+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:38:53.243475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:38:53.243475+00:00","content_hash":"7d764a319207c6c3ced9f42dde9ba9646dd05c76ef13487663f6497a490272e2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}